<h2>The floor</h2>

<ul>
  <li>{{ summit.exhibition.stands }} numbered stands across {{ summit.exhibition.halls }} halls, in a {{ summit.exhibition.tentSize }} tent</li>
  <li>Aisles of 3.0m and 2.0m between blocks</li>
  <li>Perimeter stands run along the long walls. The centre holds blocks of two</li>
  <li>The expo is on the KICC grounds rather than inside the building</li>
</ul>

<h2>How booking works</h2>

<ol>
  <li>Register and tick <strong>Exhibitor</strong>.</li>
  <li>The Secretariat emails exhibitors when rates are set and booking opens.</li>
  <li>Exhibitors select a stand from the plan in the portal and hold it.</li>
  <li>The Secretariat confirms the hold, or releases it where a stand is reserved.</li>
</ol>

<p>Registration carries no charge.</p>

<h2>Build and fit-out</h2>

